msgstr "1단계: 고전적 입력을 양자 문제로 매핑하기 {#step-1-map-classical-inputs-to-a-quantum-problem}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Map the time-evolution of a quantum Heisenberg model to a quantum experiment {#map-the-time-evolution-of-a-quantum-heisenberg-model-to-a-quantum-experiment}"
msgstr "양자 하이젠베르크 모델의 시간 진화를 양자 실험으로 매핑하기 {#map-the-time-evolution-of-a-quantum-heisenberg-model-to-a-quantum-experiment}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, we shall use the [`generate_xyz_hamiltonian`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-utils/problem-generators#generate_xyz_hamiltonian) function from `qiskit-addon-utils` to generate a Heisenberg-like Hamiltonian on a given connectivity graph. This graph can be either a [rustworkx.PyGraph](https://www.rustworkx.org/apiref/rustworkx.PyGraph.html) or a [CouplingMap](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.CouplingMap). In the following, we shall use a linear chain `CouplingMap` of 10 qubits.\n"
msgstr "먼저 `qiskit-addon-utils`의 [`generate_xyz_hamiltonian`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-utils/problem-generators#generate_xyz_hamiltonian) 함수를 사용하여 주어진 연결 그래프에서 하이젠베르크 유사 해밀토니안을 생성합니다. 이 그래프는 [rustworkx.PyGraph](https://www.rustworkx.org/apiref/rustworkx.PyGraph.html) 또는 [CouplingMap](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.CouplingMap)일 수 있습니다. 다음에서는 10개의 Qubit으로 이루어진 선형 체인 `CouplingMap`을 사용합니다.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/operator-back-propagation/extracted-outputs/a3debf65-06df-4277-933e-14b6f6170756-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![이전 코드 셀의 출력](/docs/images/tutorials/operator-back-propagation/extracted-outputs/a3debf65-06df-4277-933e-14b6f6170756-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, we generate a Pauli operator modeling a Heisenberg XYZ Hamiltonian:\n"
msgstr "다음으로, 하이젠베르크 XYZ 해밀토니안을 모델링하는 Pauli 연산자를 생성합니다.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"{\\hat{\\mathcal{H}}_{XYZ} = \\sum_{(j,k)\\in E} (J_{x} \\sigma_j^{x} \\sigma_{k}^{x} + J_{y} \\sigma_j^{y} \\sigma_{k}^{y} + J_{z} \\sigma_j^{z} \\sigma_{k}^{z}) + \\sum_{j\\in V} (h_{x} \\sigma_j^{x} + h_{y} \\sigma_j^{y} + h_{z} \\sigma_j^{z}),}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"{\\hat{\\mathcal{H}}_{XYZ} = \\sum_{(j,k)\\in E} (J_{x} \\sigma_j^{x} \\sigma_{k}^{x} + J_{y} \\sigma_j^{y} \\sigma_{k}^{y} + J_{z} \\sigma_j^{z} \\sigma_{k}^{z}) + \\sum_{j\\in V} (h_{x} \\sigma_j^{x} + h_{y} \\sigma_j^{y} + h_{z} \\sigma_j^{z}),}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "where $G(V,E)$ is the graph of the coupling map. For this tutorial, we have used $J_x, J_y, J_z$ to be $\\frac{\\pi}{8}, \\frac{\\pi}{4}, \\frac{\\pi}{2}$, respectively, and $h_x, h_y, h_z$ to be $\\frac{\\pi}{3}, \\frac{\\pi}{6}, \\frac{\\pi}{9}$, respectively.\n"
msgstr "여기서 $G(V,E)$는 커플링 맵의 그래프입니다. 이 튜토리얼에서는 $J_x, J_y, J_z$를 각각 $\\frac{\\pi}{8}, \\frac{\\pi}{4}, \\frac{\\pi}{2}$로, $h_x, h_y, h_z$를 각각 $\\frac{\\pi}{3}, \\frac{\\pi}{6}, \\frac{\\pi}{9}$로 설정하였습니다.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "From the qubit operator, we can generate a quantum circuit which models its time evolution. We have used [`generate_time_evolution_circuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-utils/problem-generators#generate_time_evolution_circuit) with Lie Trotter decomposition to construct the time evolution circuit.\n"
msgstr "큐비트 연산자로부터 시간 진화를 모델링하는 양자 회로를 생성할 수 있습니다. [`generate_time_evolution_circuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-utils/problem-generators#generate_time_evolution_circuit)을 Lie Trotter 분해와 함께 사용하여 시간 진화 회로를 구성하였습니다.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/operator-back-propagation/extracted-outputs/5208e0a8-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![이전 코드 셀의 출력](/docs/images/tutorials/operator-back-propagation/extracted-outputs/5208e0a8-0.avif)\n"

